":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"wVrJOXjRrPKIfZbNnrl3ow","review_id":"JCaF-Tm2g17N0c4YBl34fA","date":"2020-02-15T23:46:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9480870962142944,"text_excerpt":"I'm from Chicago; New Orleans doesn't have good pizza. It just doesn't. But Pizza Delicious is as good as it gets. Personally I don't like New York style pies - this is definitely that. But thanks to an inventive, rotating slice of the day (always vegetarian-friendly), delicious garlic knots and cauliflower rolls, serviceable salads, and free delivery, Pizza D is by default the best pizza place this side of Canal Street and a great overall business. I've tried nearly all of the veggie slices. The cauliflower with pickled red onion stands out. Delivery is consistent in terms of the \"driver\" (in this case, always via bicycle) but the pizza is not always fresh or hot. A couple of times, it's..."},{"business_id":"wVrJOXjRrPKIfZbNnrl3ow","review_id":"bsa7YTjt-FVKPmak_S2Y7Q","date":"2017-11-13T19:40:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9470789432525635,"text_excerpt":"I honestly wasn't sure what to expect from Pizza Delicious being that I'm from NY and am a bit of a pizza snob. With that said, I heard good things so I decided to stop by and I honestly was impressed. Is this the best pizza I've ever tried? No. But is this as close as you'll get to NYC pizza in New Orleans? Definitely. And it tastes great, too-the crust had a nice bite and the sauce was flavorful. We ordered a margarita pie ($19) and a few cheese slices to compare (a cheese pie is $15 which is extremely affordable, in my opinion). The margarita pie was good, but it didn't remind me of an authentic margarita pie. The cheese slice, however, was awesome. Next time I go, I'd probably just st..."},{"business_id":"wVrJOXjRrPKIfZbNnrl3ow","review_id":"Qinl2iZM3bcpeyMoWo7Dww","date":"2013-03-25T22:18:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9449747204780579,"text_excerpt":"No question this is the best pizza in NOLA. If you doubt me, have fun proving me wrong. Only those who are deep dish afficionados will disagree. I went there recently with 2 dining companions, and we barely were able to split a $16 pepperoni. The thing looked like a wagon wheel, and it was covered wall to wall in pepperoni, not just a few token guys. Working down next was a perfect thickness of flavorful cheese (no white rubber here), then the best pizza sauce in the city, tangy but not too with a little kick for fun. All of this perfection was sitting atop a thin crust that has no rival that I have found. I will say we asked the guys to cook ours a bit longer based on what we were seeing..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"wVrJOXjRrPKIfZbNnrl3ow","photo_id":"7p-xpPMsXLTCQ6lAzbg0mQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/7p-xpPMsXLTCQ6lAzbg0mQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9068427085876465},{"business_id":"wVrJOXjRrPKIfZbNnrl3ow","photo_id":"7Griwmn3cpkAz_EnW6_Krw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/7Griwmn3cpkAz_EnW6_Krw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8806525468826294},{"business_id":"wVrJOXjRrPKIfZbNnrl3ow","photo_id":"sxnNIyoKg5titutv40NE3Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/sxnNIyoKg5titutv40NE3Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8593283891677856},{"business_id":"wVrJOXjRrPKIfZbNnrl3ow","photo_id":"_L5ShkwMmuvJKbXQgay9IQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_L5ShkwMmuvJKbXQgay9IQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8359907269477844},{"business_id":"wVrJOXjRrPKIfZbNnrl3ow","photo_id":"D5HrvPO5pa6c7qU3266ifg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/D5HrvPO5pa6c7qU3266ifg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.733563244342804}]},"notebook_case":null}
